            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I am an absolute beginner and was concerned that I would be overwhelmed. Alan was patient and helped me get to grip with the basics. He shared his knowledge and experience with the group. A thoroughly enjoyable afternoon in the beautiful Peak District."
        },
        {
          "@type": "Review",
