          "reviewRating": {
            "@type": "Rating",
            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "I have attended a few good workshop with Alan and done some face to face lessons and summarizing, if you are looking for passionate, knowledgeable photographer who will guide you through this sometime complicated but also fascinating world, it is Alan. He is not a photographer but and artist and soulful person, who will inspire you with his stories as a person and teach you a lot with his experience. Workshops gave me very valuable time in beautiful places and interesting people, which worth is"
        },
