            "ratingValue": "5",
            "bestRating": "5",
            "worstRating": "1"
          },
          "reviewBody": "Alan's workshop was my first such course and combined a perfect combination of theory and practical guidance on composition and camera use. Regardless of your level of experience, Alan's workshops provide a friendly and constructive environment in which to enhance your skills. I look forward to the next one."
        },
